-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers THE CODE IN THIS REPOSITORY: the GDScript, the
Godot project and scenes, the asset converters and build scripts under
`tools/`, the packaging under `packaging/`, and the documentation under
`docs/`. Take it, read it, port it, reuse it.

It does NOT cover the original game's graphics, sound, music, voice lines or
map data. Those belong to The Bitmap Brothers, and nobody here can license
them to you. They are not in this repository — `assets_original/` and
`project/assets/` are gitignored, and the converters read from your own copy
of the retail release. The screenshots under `docs/screenshots/` are included
for documentation.

A build produced by `tools/build_releases.sh` EMBEDS those assets, so a
binary is not covered by the license above either. Build one for yourself
from your own copy of the game.

Z is a trademark of its owners. This project is unaffiliated with The Bitmap
Brothers and with GOG.
